WEBVTT

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:12.150
Dreams aren't just dreams anymore.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:14.450
Thanks, everyone...

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.480
Owie, ouch, ow!

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:22.670
And I was having such a nice dream about PriPara...

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:24.000
Huh? Dream?!

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.840
Found it! Phew.

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:33.940
PriPara sure was fun.

00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:35.180
I wanna go again...

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:36.930
<i>PriPara is strictly forbidden!</i>

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:42.640
Forbidden, huh? But I already went anyway...

00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:45.640
<i>I've heard of crazy punishments...</i>

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:48.840
Oh no, I'm getting freaked out!

00:00:48.840 --> 00:00:50.660
But I still wanna go back to PriPara!

00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:51.860
What's going on?

00:00:52.380 --> 00:00:53.860
You wanna go where?

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:56.970
Non? It's nothing! Nothing!

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:59.980
Hmm, well I'm off to school anyway.

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:01.850
Okay, see you.

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:04.910
You should probably hurry, too.
It's already 8 o'clock.

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:06.960
Whaaat?

00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:25.730
Stop trying to be like that other girl

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:31.750
You're better off just being you

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:37.180
Can't you feel it in your heart?

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:42.970
Let's go look for our own ideals

00:01:43.700 --> 00:01:48.480
And every single memory we make

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:51.960
We'll snap in two and

00:01:51.960 --> 00:01:57.400
Complete the set with our friends

00:01:59.720 --> 00:02:04.910
Make it! You're unbeatable once you get started

00:02:05.220 --> 00:02:10.630
Make up! Headed for a gloriously shining future

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:16.490
Dreams aren't just dreams anymore

00:02:16.490 --> 00:02:19.990
Anyone can make theirs true now

00:02:19.990 --> 00:02:22.430
Pripara Priparadise

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:46.470
Hold up! Don't close the gate!

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:52.050
Five, four, three, two, one, zero.

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:57.150
Manaka from Class 5-2. Late again.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:03:01.640
What? Head Disciplinarian Minami, please!

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:05.590
I can't watch TV all day if my parents find out I was late!

00:03:05.590 --> 00:03:08.830
That's unfortunate. But the school rules are the same for everyone.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:12.300
Rule #3141 of Paprika Private Academy:

00:03:12.300 --> 00:03:15.580
No making excuses when warned for a transgression.

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:19.760
Your 97th and 98th tickets.

00:03:32.490 --> 00:03:36.270
That's fine, Takahashi. Very good.

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:39.040
And next, Manaka.

00:03:39.040 --> 00:03:40.390
Good luck.

00:03:42.140 --> 00:03:42.800
Go on.

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:55.510
<i>I could sing so well in PriPara yesterday.</i>

00:03:55.510 --> 00:03:59.050
<i>With all my heart, so everyone the world over could hear.</i>

00:04:04.050 --> 00:04:07.100
Manaka, please put some spirit into it.

00:04:07.100 --> 00:04:09.900
Your speaking voice is much louder.

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:10.730
Yes...

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:15.270
I just can't do it.

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:19.840
When I'm just talking, I get really loud even without noticing.

00:04:19.840 --> 00:04:24.240
But when it's time to show off, I'm just no good.

00:04:24.540 --> 00:04:28.720
I wonder if PriPara is just special like that.

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:31.570
I can smell it!

00:04:32.900 --> 00:04:35.250
The smell of PriTickets!

00:04:35.250 --> 00:04:38.460
You can't fool Ookanda Gloria's nose!

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:40.480
Headmistress?

00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:44.050
Phew... If I had my PriTickets, they'd get confiscated.

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:46.220
What!?

00:04:48.680 --> 00:04:51.640
Wh-Why!? I totally left them at home!

00:04:53.390 --> 00:04:55.000
<i>Oh no, I'm gonna be late!</i>

00:04:56.440 --> 00:05:00.020
<i>I was in such a rush that I lost track of them at some point!</i>

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:04.790
I'll be having those! Don't even try to run
<i>What now? They'll get confiscated!</i>

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:07.030
You there!

00:05:08.490 --> 00:05:09.700
What?

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:11.910
I'm taking those!

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:19.130
I knew you were hiding some!

00:05:19.130 --> 00:05:20.590
I'm sorry...

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.960
Phew.

00:05:25.080 --> 00:05:28.300
We did good yesterday, if I do say so myself-kuma.

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:31.960
We passed the audition.

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:34.050
I'm making steady progress

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:36.290
on the road the becoming the number one scout-kuma.

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:43.940
What's a <i>loser</i> scout like you <i>losering</i> around here for-usa?

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:45.280
You're Usagi!

00:05:46.250 --> 00:05:47.980
Don't call me that!

00:05:47.980 --> 00:05:51.380
My name is Will Michel George Sandol—

00:05:51.380 --> 00:05:53.330
Whaddya want, Usagi?
My name is Will Michel George Sandol—

00:05:54.420 --> 00:06:01.080
I simply saw a stupid face that was just <i>begging</i> to be made fun and proceeded to make fun of it.

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:02.340
Goodbye-usa.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:09.450
Once you get fired and end up in the mascot graveyard, I'll send some flowers...

00:06:09.450 --> 00:06:10.260
to someone else-usa.

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:14.350
Shut up-kuma! I've got news for you!

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:18.890
I happened upon some very promising new idols just recently-kuma.

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:22.520
I'll be taking over your number one spot soon enough,

00:06:22.860 --> 00:06:24.130
so you'd best prepare yourself-kuma.

00:06:24.130 --> 00:06:25.960
Really-usa?

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:26.990
So what's their class? Top Idol? Godly Idol?

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:30.010
God
Top
Major
Debut

00:06:30.010 --> 00:06:30.890
Uhh...

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:32.310
Debut
Major
Top
God

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:34.950
They're still just idol students-kuma.

00:06:38.890 --> 00:06:40.350
What are you even on about?

00:06:40.350 --> 00:06:47.570
I don't have time for this. I've got scheduling to do for the number one idol, Houjou Sophie.

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:51.000
She's a real genius. She managed to reach God-tier in no time at all.

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:53.680
She shines like a diamond-usa.

00:06:54.450 --> 00:06:57.980
Please, contain your jealousy-usa. Adieu!

00:07:00.010 --> 00:07:01.690
How dare you mock me-kuma!

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:03.920
Just you wait-kuma!

00:07:03.920 --> 00:07:06.850
I'll have my Lala and Mirei team topping charts!

00:07:06.850 --> 00:07:12.030
And after that, I'm gonna treat that stupid bunny like trash!

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:17.340
<i>I managed to get myself out of that...</i>

00:07:17.340 --> 00:07:19.580
<i>But the headmistress is on the lookout.</i>

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:23.790
<i>I don't wanna lose my PriTickets.</i>

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:25.540
<i>That was nice, Lala!</i>

00:07:27.400 --> 00:07:32.370
<i>But it's against the rules... Am I a bad girl?</i>

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:34.850
Ah! What should I do?

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:37.100
What's up, Lala?

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:39.280
Huh? Oh, it's just you.

00:07:39.280 --> 00:07:40.430
Just me.

00:07:41.120 --> 00:07:46.150
So, Nao, I actually...

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:51.600
I heard someone from third year got their PriTickets confiscated.

00:07:51.600 --> 00:07:57.490
I heard she might be getting punished because she was stashing so many.

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:59.450
P-Punished?

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:03.250
Like, b-burned to death or having to wear "idiot" on her face?

00:08:03.550 --> 00:08:05.130
Something even worse.

00:08:05.130 --> 00:08:08.390
Like having nothing but fried eggplants at lunch every day until graduation.

00:08:08.390 --> 00:08:08.800
No way!

00:08:09.180 --> 00:08:11.560
Or having to run ten laps around the school grounds before getting to leave every day.

00:08:11.560 --> 00:08:12.380
Inhuman!

00:08:12.700 --> 00:08:14.480
Or even having their summer vacation taken away!

00:08:14.480 --> 00:08:15.470
They can't do that!

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:17.390
What's the point of being a grade schooler?

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:19.980
So Nao, I...

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:25.620
<i>I stuck the PriPass in my bag too!</i>

00:08:25.620 --> 00:08:28.570
What's that? A smartphone? You've got a smartphone?

00:08:29.180 --> 00:08:32.000
Er, I, uh, gotta go to the bathroom!

00:08:36.260 --> 00:08:39.030
Hi! How are you-kuma?

00:08:39.030 --> 00:08:42.750
Mr. Kuma! We aren't allowed to use phones at school.

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:44.650
Smartphones and stuff are banned here!

00:08:44.650 --> 00:08:47.630
Well, I guess I was the one who accidentally brought it, but...

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.940
I see. Sorry about that.

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:55.720
More importantly-kuma, I want you to keep racking up performances to increase your rank!

00:08:55.720 --> 00:08:58.720
You're coming for today's performance, right, honey?

00:09:00.670 --> 00:09:02.680
W-Well...

00:09:04.810 --> 00:09:08.330
I... I can't come back!

00:09:08.900 --> 00:09:10.270
I <i>really</i> can't come back!

00:09:10.270 --> 00:09:15.930
Kuma? Whawhawhawha? Wh-Wh-Wh-Why-kuma!?

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:18.790
What will happen to my plan to become the number one manager-kuma?

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:21.030
What about your promise with Mireille?

00:09:21.030 --> 00:09:23.390
I'm sorry! And please tell her I'm sorry too.

00:09:23.390 --> 00:09:24.770
What's up with that?

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:25.830
I just can't!

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:27.080
Just wait a kuma-moment!

00:09:27.080 --> 00:09:29.000
I said I can't!

00:09:29.910 --> 00:09:31.000
Manaka.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:36.710
Rule #4953 of Paprika Private Academy:

00:09:36.710 --> 00:09:38.930
Needlessly making loud noises is not allowed on school grounds!

00:09:38.930 --> 00:09:40.680
No loud
noises!

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:42.410
Loud noises?

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:48.030
Lady Sophie!

00:09:48.030 --> 00:09:51.970
School ending sooner than usual because of the exam means more PriPara time!

00:09:51.970 --> 00:09:52.270
Chanko!

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:53.790
And your rank has increased!

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:55.820
Today's show is gonna be big!

00:10:00.800 --> 00:10:02.450
Try your hardest!

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:06.870
Sophie Fanclub #1 will support you!

00:10:07.450 --> 00:10:10.880
My hardest? Never heard of it.

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:14.710
She's. So. Damn. Cool!

00:10:14.710 --> 00:10:15.590
Chanko!

00:10:15.590 --> 00:10:17.300
Wisdom from the genius Lady Sophie!

00:10:17.300 --> 00:10:18.080
Chanko!

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:20.330
I can't believe how cool she is!

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:22.640
We'll follow you anywhere!

00:10:22.880 --> 00:10:27.780
Lala's such a troublemaker...

00:10:27.780 --> 00:10:30.560
I ain't clowning around here-kuma.

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:33.020
Mireille coming in-pri!

00:10:33.020 --> 00:10:37.490
Mireille! This is bad! Lala said she's not coming to PriPara anymore!

00:10:37.890 --> 00:10:40.860
What? What are you saying-pri?

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:42.800
I don't know-kuma!

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:45.950
No way! She promised we'd sing together-pri!

00:10:45.950 --> 00:10:47.830
Why isn't she coming?!

00:10:48.280 --> 00:10:49.790
Why?

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:51.030
Lala...

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:56.510
What do we do-kuma? We can't participate without her-kuma!

00:11:07.890 --> 00:11:11.650
What now, Mireille-kuma?
Do we just sit this one out-kuma?

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:14.880
We've got time before the entries close-pri.

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:17.310
If Lala arrives before then, we're in the clear-pri.

00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:21.110
In the clear? You think Lala's really coming?

00:11:21.930 --> 00:11:23.320
I trust Lala-pri.

00:11:23.890 --> 00:11:25.330
We made a promise-pri.

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:28.820
Is that part of your calculations? Or just what you're hoping for?

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:31.340
A pop and a step and I've gotcha!

00:11:31.340 --> 00:11:33.500
Mireille out!

00:11:33.790 --> 00:11:35.950
Mireille-kuma...

00:11:41.980 --> 00:11:45.390
Hey, are you seriously not coming-kuma?

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:48.630
Mr. Kuma! I told you not to call me here!

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:51.350
I'm really going to get in trouble like this!

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:54.840
You say that now, but you're actually planning on coming, right?

00:11:54.840 --> 00:12:00.190
I know. The ladies can't resist my charm.

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:02.760
What your deal? Bye.

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:04.160
What?

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:06.000
What is this-kuma?

00:12:06.890 --> 00:12:11.070
What's happening-kuma? My chest is suddenly...

00:12:11.070 --> 00:12:14.500
My chest... hurts so much-kuma!

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:16.460
Mr. Kuma? What's wrong?

00:12:16.810 --> 00:12:22.840
I'm done for-kuma... It hurts-kuma!

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:26.300
You have to come save me right now-kuma!

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:28.010
Mr. Kuma! Keep it together!

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:32.480
My head feels like it's splitting... Please hurry!

00:12:33.050 --> 00:12:36.190
Huh? Wasn't it your chest?

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:40.650
What? Really-kuma? I guess it's spreading, or y'know—

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:42.870
Oh, sorry about that.

00:12:43.650 --> 00:12:46.950
Oh no! My perfect FX makeup!

00:12:46.950 --> 00:12:50.660
You're actually fine, aren't you, Mr. Kuma? Geez... Bye!

00:12:50.660 --> 00:12:52.620
W-Wait-kuma!

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:56.080
Mireille is also waiting for you-kuma!

00:12:57.620 --> 00:12:59.500
She's absolutely sure you'll come!

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:03.520
She's practicing in the training room right now-kuma!

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:08.220
Putting her everything into every single performance is Mireille's style-kuma!

00:13:10.070 --> 00:13:10.930
Mireille...

00:13:11.840 --> 00:13:14.240
She just keeps waiting and waiting.

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:17.600
She hasn't had a thing to eat or drink in three days!

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:19.560
Three days?

00:13:19.980 --> 00:13:22.150
I can't take it anymore-kuma!

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:23.030
Huh?

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:27.990
Uh-huh. That's what you'd call a tall tale.

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:29.840
What!?

00:13:29.840 --> 00:13:32.700
Kid these days are tough to fool-kuma.

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:34.410
Anyway, bye.

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:36.040
No, wait!

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:46.970
<i>I've been training pri-hard day in day out for this! Pri-please help me out! I'm begging you-pri!</i>

00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:50.300
What am I doing?

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:51.760
I have to go!

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:53.810
I'm sorry, Mireille!

00:13:54.340 --> 00:13:58.700
<i>These are Friend Tickets-pri. You trade these with friends.</i>

00:13:58.700 --> 00:14:00.860
<i>Let's perform together again!</i>

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:03.440
I'm going! I have to go!

00:14:03.910 --> 00:14:05.000
I want to go!

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:11.700
So what were you trying to say earlier, Lala?

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:13.370
I'll tell you later! Later!

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:17.190
I'm getting really curious now. And what's with the rush?

00:14:17.190 --> 00:14:18.850
Something waiting for you at home?

00:14:18.850 --> 00:14:19.830
Er, uh...

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:40.480
Good grief. Who would just throw their garbage on the floor?

00:14:40.990 --> 00:14:43.860
Keep the school clean!

00:14:43.860 --> 00:14:46.570
Kids these days...

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:55.200
You...

00:14:56.720 --> 00:14:57.990
You! You there!

00:14:57.990 --> 00:14:59.210
Yes?

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:03.170
I can smell them. I can so <i>clearly</i> smell them.

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:06.590
You're hiding PriTickets, aren't you?

00:15:08.360 --> 00:15:11.960
What's with that reaction? Screaming when you see someone like me?

00:15:11.960 --> 00:15:13.870
You're just scary!

00:15:13.870 --> 00:15:14.430
How rude!

00:15:14.970 --> 00:15:17.270
Lala? Did you get a PriTicket?

00:15:17.550 --> 00:15:21.240
You can't fool my PriTicket sensor!

00:15:21.240 --> 00:15:24.190
It's in that pocket! Turn it in at once!

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:27.530
<i>What now?</i>

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:30.890
What are you doing? Hand it over!

00:15:30.890 --> 00:15:33.020
<i>I'm done for...</i>

00:15:33.980 --> 00:15:34.620
Hurry up!

00:15:35.630 --> 00:15:36.360
Here!

00:15:36.360 --> 00:15:38.040
This is all I've got!

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:42.630
B-But that can't be!

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:45.590
I'm gonna be late for cram school!

00:15:46.000 --> 00:15:49.920
Hey! Don't think for a second you're getting off that easy!

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:54.260
She's very suspicious.

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:57.100
Mireille, entries are about to close-kuma!

00:15:57.580 --> 00:15:58.910
I'm not giving up-pri!

00:15:58.910 --> 00:16:00.560
Easy to say, but-kuma...

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:03.050
We promised-pri.

00:16:03.530 --> 00:16:06.330
Hi! I have to go buy a new notebook!

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:06.860
Don't—

00:16:06.860 --> 00:16:07.570
Capisce!

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:10.490
...take too long.

00:16:17.190 --> 00:16:21.620
Welcome to Prism Stone. Please insert your My Ticket.

00:16:37.970 --> 00:16:39.640
PriPara Change complete!

00:16:42.260 --> 00:16:44.730
Please note that entries will be closing soon.

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:47.440
Please hurry to the entry counter if you still wish to register.

00:16:47.980 --> 00:16:49.400
Mireille!

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:50.960
Lala!

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:52.150
What-kuma!?

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:53.970
Sorry I took so long!

00:16:53.970 --> 00:16:55.620
Don't mind that-pri!

00:16:55.620 --> 00:16:57.380
You kept your word!

00:16:57.380 --> 00:17:01.200
I... really wanted to sing with you again.

00:17:01.660 --> 00:17:03.830
We can talk later! Kuma!

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:09.880
Roger! Two more for the "Just blame the summer! GO! GO! Audition Concert"-kuma!

00:17:13.340 --> 00:17:14.920
Let's go!

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:18.510
Scan the appropriate number of PriTickets for your coord.

00:17:19.880 --> 00:17:20.760
Me too!

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:23.020
You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:26.140
Starting the Coord Change.

00:17:26.740 --> 00:17:29.190
The Wonderland Macaron One Piece.

00:17:29.190 --> 00:17:32.030
What a cute decorative bunny!

00:17:32.030 --> 00:17:33.900
The white ribbon in the back is like a bunny's tail.

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:36.990
Wonderland!

00:17:39.480 --> 00:17:41.860
The Wonderland Rabbit One Piece.

00:17:41.860 --> 00:17:46.330
What kind of show will these children lost in Wonderland perform for us?

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:50.170
Wonderland-pri!

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:03.310
<i>I'm back here! In PriPara!</i>

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:05.980
<i>I can sing from the bottom of my heart with Mireille again!</i>

00:18:50.430 --> 00:18:55.030
<i>My voice is reaching everyone! I can feel everyone around me!</i>

00:18:55.030 --> 00:18:56.150
<i>This is so fun!</i>

00:18:56.810 --> 00:18:59.660
<i>PriPara really is a special place!</i>

00:18:59.660 --> 00:19:02.660
Making Drama! Switch on!

00:19:06.040 --> 00:19:06.660
Aim for the top in dance!

00:19:12.010 --> 00:19:12.670
On the runway!

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:16.920
And in singing!

00:19:19.860 --> 00:19:21.680
Let's go! PriPara!

00:19:23.880 --> 00:19:26.390
Cyalume Change!

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:05.050
I knew I made the right call!

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:10.620
Lala's Prism Voice is still a bit rough and unstable-kuma,

00:20:10.620 --> 00:20:15.000
but with proper guidance this team will definitely become the stuff of legends!

00:20:21.890 --> 00:20:22.690
Here you go.

00:20:22.690 --> 00:20:25.170
Wow! New PriTickets!

00:20:25.170 --> 00:20:27.280
So this is how we get more!

00:20:27.280 --> 00:20:28.380
Let's swap Friend Tickets!

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:29.050
With me too!

00:20:29.050 --> 00:20:29.730
And me!

00:20:29.730 --> 00:20:30.770
Let's swap!

00:20:30.770 --> 00:20:33.710
Thank you-pri! Thank you-pri!

00:20:33.710 --> 00:20:36.480
Lala! Thanks for the lovely singing!

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:37.630
I'll come see your shows again!

00:20:37.630 --> 00:20:39.910
What? My singing?

00:20:39.910 --> 00:20:40.860
Yeah!

00:20:40.860 --> 00:20:43.170
Hey, let's swap Friend Tickets!

00:20:43.170 --> 00:20:44.930
Oh, okay!

00:20:47.200 --> 00:20:49.720
I'm your number one fan!

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:51.930
Oh, I'm so glad!

00:20:53.290 --> 00:20:57.190
<i>Idols have the power to make people happy.</i>

00:20:57.190 --> 00:21:00.150
<i>I... I...</i>

00:21:00.620 --> 00:21:03.240
I wanna be an idol for real!

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:04.780
Let's just do it-pri!

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:07.630
Well, there's a reason I can't...

00:21:07.630 --> 00:21:09.290
What reason's that-pri?

00:21:09.760 --> 00:21:13.370
Our school's students aren't allowed to do PriPara.

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:14.830
Huh?

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:17.880
What's with that? I thought that was just my school...

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:32.060
Huh?

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:33.090
Manaka?

00:21:33.090 --> 00:21:34.930
Head Disciplinarian Minami?

00:23:05.740 --> 00:23:09.060
What? Mireille is the Head Disciplinarian?

00:23:09.060 --> 00:23:10.500
That's crazy!

00:23:10.500 --> 00:23:12.240
There's no time for that-kuma!

00:23:12.240 --> 00:23:14.830
Your smile and your walking and your everything, it's all wrong-kuma!

00:23:14.830 --> 00:23:17.170
Your idol career will be over in no time if you keep this up!

00:23:17.170 --> 00:23:18.870
N-No way!

00:23:18.870 --> 00:23:23.380
The future of your teamup will be decided with the Making Drama-kuma!

00:23:23.380 --> 00:23:28.170
Buffet Floppy? I have no idea what's going on, but I guess we just have to go for it!

00:23:28.170 --> 00:23:31.980
Next time: Team Breakup? No Way-kuma~!

00:23:31.980 --> 00:23:34.970
Go for it! Let's go! PriPara!
